# PC card team-quarters (TMODE-45, BENCH-225): gate arm bb (A/A) on the picked teams (work/team-quarters-picked.txt), 16 fresh seeds from 9800, against master (the aa build). Template: qtprep/qtgprep writes work/team-quarters-gbb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
9800
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-quarters-picked.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-quarters-@V@-gbb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-quarters-gbb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
